@* D548: two token counters, never added into one number. *@
<p class="field-hint token-counters" role="note"><strong>Sent by us</strong> is Skanyxx's own estimate of what it sent the agents (messages, files and the context it added). <strong>Spent by model</strong> (input and output) is the model's own count, as kagent reports it: limits and costs use only that.</p>
